  "2026-08-01T18:19:24.077Z","harness:codex","Manual packed-consumer evidence: independent npm and Bun install roots each resolved node_modules/@unbrained/pm-cli/dist/cli.js, executed the compiled shim with leading pm and pm-cli tokens, returned contracts summary, and rejected pm-definitely-missing with exit 2. Registry package-default npx/bunx legs remain release-time checks because local tarball package-default syntax is not supported by those executors."
  "2026-08-01T18:54:34.753Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence: bootstrap/verifier regressions, the full 6,673-test suite, exact 100/100/100/100 coverage, lint/static gates, type checks, docs/skills, secret scan, and pnpm audit all passed. Root help contains no pm pseudo-command entry; pm appears only as the root name and valid example."
